<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE CUP SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE CUP SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of French League Cup second</p>
<p>round matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Monaco	     3  Troyes		3 after extra time</p>
<p>Monaco won 4-2 on penalties</p>
<p> Montpellier	2  Bastia		2</p>
<p>Montpellier won 4-2 on penalties</p>
<p> Le Mans	    2  Epinal		0</p>
<p> Rennes	     1  Le Havre	    0</p>
<p> Niort		0  Lens		  2</p>
<p> Nice		 2  Caen		  2</p>
<p>Caen won 5-4 on penalties</p>
<p> Nantes	     2  Valence	     1</p>
<p> Cannes	     1  Nancy		 0</p>
<p> Strasbourg	 3  Saint-Etienne     0</p>
<p> Bordeaux	   3  Chateauroux	 0</p>
<p> Metz		 2  Lorient	     0</p>
<p> Toulouse	   2  Louhans-Cuiseaux  3</p>
<p> Toulon	     2  Lille		 1</p>
<p> Nimes		1  Guingamp	    0</p>
<p>Played on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Lyon		 2  Paris St-Germain  1</p>
<p> Marseille	  3  Auxerre	     2</p>
